          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept liquidated damages payable by us, particularly at 15% of annual Fees per week, which is uncapped and would quickly exceed the contract value. We have replaced it with ordinary interest on undisputed overdue amounts, consistent with the dispute mechanism in Section 7.3.",
